---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Best Dream11 Alternatives in India: Top Gaming Apps';
const seoDescription =
	'Explore the best Dream11 alternatives in India including Comegame and other platforms. Compare features, usability, and find the right option.';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://www.comegameapp.com/blog/best-dream11-alternatives-india-comegame';
const ogImage = 'https://www.comegameapp.com/android-chrome-512x512.png';
const keywordsMeta =
	'dream11 alternative india, apps like dream11, comegame vs dream11, fantasy apps india, best gaming apps india';

const articleSchema = {
	'@context': 'https://schema.org',
	'@type': 'BlogPosting',
	headline: seoTitle,
	description: seoDescription,
	url: canonicalUrl,
	image: ogImage,
	datePublished: '2026-03-24',
	dateModified: '2026-03-24',
	inLanguage: 'en-IN',
	author: {
		'@type': 'Organization',
		name: 'Come Game Guide',
	},
	publisher: {
		'@type': 'Organization',
		name: 'Come Game Guide',
		logo: {
			'@type': 'ImageObject',
			url: ogImage,
		},
	},
	mainEntityOfPage: canonicalUrl,
};
---

<Layout
	title={seoTitle}
	description={seoDescription}
	keywords={keywordsMeta}
	canonical={canonicalUrl}
	ogImage={ogImage}
>
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)}></script>
	</Fragment>

	<article class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
		<header class="max-w-4xl">
			<a
				href="/blog"
				class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-border bg-card px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground"
			>
				Back to Blog
			</a>
			<h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-5xl">
				Best Dream11 Alternatives in India: Top Gaming Apps
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-muted-foreground">Published on March 24, 2026 | Comparison Guide</p>
			<p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground md:text-lg">
				Dream11 is popular, but many users in India now explore alternatives based on simplicity, features,
				and user experience. The best platform depends on your own preferences, not just popularity.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="mt-10 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Why Users Look for Alternatives</h2>
			<ul class="mt-5 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				<li>Preference for simpler interfaces and faster onboarding.</li>
				<li>Need for different gameplay formats and broader options.</li>
				<li>Changing regulations and platform models in India.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Popular Dream11 Alternatives</h2>
			<div class="mt-5 space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				<p>
					<strong class="text-foreground">My11Circle:</strong> Familiar fantasy structure, strong cricket focus,
					and easy transition for existing fantasy users.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-foreground">MPL:</strong> Multi-gaming app with fantasy, casual, and arcade options
					for users who prefer variety.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Gamezy:</strong> User-friendly design with flexible formats and regional
					support.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-foreground">PlayerzPot:</strong> Multi-sport coverage and a stable, clean user
					experience.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Vision11:</strong> Often preferred by beginners due to manageable contest
					structure.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong class="text-foreground">Comegame:</strong> Emerging option focused on simple, accessible, and less
					complex gameplay flow.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">How to Choose the Right One</h2>
			<ul class="mt-5 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
				<li>If you want beginner-friendly simplicity, consider Comegame or Vision11.</li>
				<li>If you want a Dream11-like fantasy structure, consider My11Circle or PlayerzPot.</li>
				<li>If you want multiple gaming categories, MPL is a strong option.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="mt-8 max-w-4xl rounded-xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 p-6">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl">Conclusion</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-foreground">
				There is no single best Dream11 alternative for everyone. The right choice depends on your comfort
				level, preferred gameplay style, and the type of platform experience you want.
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>
